  "details": "Hi, I was a well-known game developer on the Horizon Worlds platform. Among other things, I made the Spade card game for Hardy West and several other games. Now I'm on VRChat, and the only thing missing here is an easy online tool for creating avatars. I can do it with the VRChat Creator companion app, but it's too complicated for people without knowledge of Unity, Blender, etc. Following Meta's announcement about closing its world to VR, I believe this is the only thing you're missing to attract Horizon Worlds' customer base.\n\nI hope my suggestion is constructive.\n\nBillProduction",
